title: An empty folder that is not a repository: the changes panel, staging, committing, discarding, a commit and the diff neither crash nor create anything
folders: empty
absent-file: empty/.git
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
wait 800
mark 1-panel
wait 500
part stage nothing.txt 1
wait 1200
git stage
wait 1200
git commit nothing here
wait 1200
git discard
wait 800
mark 2-discard-asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1200
commit 0
wait 1000
diff on
wait 1000
diff split
wait 1000
changed on
wait 1000
mark 3-end
wait 500
quit
